      │  ├─ this is NOT the 10s cap — the cap reports \`timed-out\` and settles first
      │  └─ another party ended the probe: an oom killer, a ci runner cap, or a supervisor
      │
      ├─ fix: run the probe by hand, then read what ended the last one
      │  └─ rhx clone whoami --output json
      │
