   │
   └─ ✋ halted, brain switch could not land
      ├─ this driver runs = unknown — the clone probe did not answer in time
      │
      ├─ why
      │  ├─ \`clone whoami\` was still alive at the 10s cap, and was killed
      │  └─ the cap names no cause — the probe may have been about to report any of them
      │
      ├─ fix: run the probe by hand, unhurried, and read what it reports
      │  └─ rhx clone whoami --output json
      │
      ├─ and: if it reports an unenrolled driver — the most common cause — re-enroll
      │  └─ rhx enroll claude --as @:driver --roles driver
      │
      └─ or: remove \`brain:\` from the stone's guard, and inherit the brain deliberately
         └─ 1.vision.guard
"
`;

